      en: ["Construction start: 1059.", "Completion: 1106.", "Dome fresco: 'Assumption of the Virgin' by Correggio (1526-1530).", "Dome height: 28 m.", "Cathedral length: 93 m.", "Baptistery: built 1196-1300."],
